#: app/text.py:13
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hey there! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to <b>CONQUEER</b> — where queer kings conquer connections! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Whether you're ready to:\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — Casual hookups and wild nights\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find your king or prince\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Build your chosen family\n"
"\n"
"Your kingdom awaits! Create your profile and start conquering.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Be bold. Be proud. Be you.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Salut ! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"Bienvenue sur <b>CONQUEER</b> — là où les rois queer conquièrent des "
"connexions ! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Que tu sois prêt pour :\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun</b> — Plans cul et nuits torrides\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating</b> — Trouve ton roi ou ton prince\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends</b> — Construis ta famille de cœur\n"
"\n"
"Ton royaume t'attend ! Crée ton profil et pars à la conquête.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Sois audacieux. Sois fier. Sois toi-même.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"

#: app/text.py:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>About CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your platform to conquer the dating scene — built by queer men, for queer"
" men.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Three Modes. Infinite Possibilities:</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — No strings, just vibes\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find something real\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Your queer tribe\n"
"\n"
"<b>Conquer On Your Terms:</b>\n"
"- Choose your role: Top, Bottom, or Verse\n"
"- Filter by age range and hosting\n"
"- Location-based matching\n"
"- Safe, private, and judgment-free\n"
"\n"
"Now go forth and conquer! 👑\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>À propos de CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ta plateforme pour conquérir le monde des rencontres — conçue par des "
"hommes queer, pour des hommes queer.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Trois modes. Des possibilités infinies :</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun</b> — Sans prise de tête, que du plaisir\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating</b> — Trouve une vraie connexion\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends</b> — Ta communauté queer\n"
"\n"
"<b>Conquiers à tes conditions :</b>\n"
"- Choisis ton rôle : Top, Bottom ou Versatile\n"
"- Filtre par tranche d'âge et hébergement\n"
"- Matchs par localisation\n"
"- Sûr, privé et sans jugement\n"
"\n"
"Maintenant, pars à la conquête ! 👑\n"

#: app/text.py:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>CONQUEER Command Center</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 My Profile — Own your presence\n"
"✉️ Invite Friends — Expand the kingdom\n"
"🎭 Enter Mode — Start conquering\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Centre de Commandement CONQUEER</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 Mon profil — Assume ta présence\n"
"✉️ Inviter des amis — Agrandis le royaume\n"
"🎭 Choisir un mode — Pars à la conquête\n"

#: app/text.py:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Choose Your Conquest</b>\n"
"\n"
"What are you hunting for today?\n"
"\n"
"Pick your mode and start browsing:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Choisis ta conquête</b>\n"
"\n"
"Que recherches-tu aujourd'hui ?\n"
"\n"
"Choisis ton mode et commence à explorer :\n"

#: app/text.py:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ready to play?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse hot matches\n"
"📭 - See who wants you\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun Actif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Prêt à jouer ?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Découvrir des profils chauds\n"
"📭 - Voir qui te désire\n"
"🎂 - Définir la tranche d'âge\n"
"🏠 - Préférence de logement\n"
"💤 - Retour au menu principal\n"

#: app/text.py:88
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something real?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse potential matches\n"
"📭 - See who's interested\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating Actif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tu cherches du sérieux ?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Découvrir des profils compatibles\n"
"📭 - Voir qui s'intéresse à toi\n"
"🎂 - Définir la tranche d'âge\n"
"🏠 - Préférence de logement\n"
"💤 - Retour au menu principal\n"

#: app/text.py:102
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse friendly faces\n"
"📭 - See who reached out\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends Actif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tu veux élargir ton cercle ?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Découvrir des visages amicaux\n"
"📭 - Voir qui t'a contacté\n"
"🎂 - Définir la tranche d'âge\n"
"🏠 - Préférence de logement\n"
"💤 - Retour au menu principal\n"

#: app/text.py:116
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Profile Management</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Recreate profile\n"
"🖼 Change photo\n"
"✍️ Change description\n"
"❌ Disable profile\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Back\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Gestion du profil</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Recréer le profil\n"
"🖼 Changer de photo\n"
"✍️ Modifier la description\n"
"❌ Désactiver le profil\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Retour\n"

#: app/text.py:129
msgid "Unknown command, king. Type /start to get back on track. 👑"
msgstr "Commande inconnue, roi. Tape /start pour revenir au menu. 👑"

#: app/text.py:134
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Time to play! You're now browsing guys looking for casual hookups and "
"steamy encounters.\n"
"\n"
"Who's ready for you tonight? Let's find out! 🔥\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun activé !</b>\n"
"\n"
"C'est l'heure de jouer ! Tu découvres maintenant des mecs chauds pour des"
" plans cul sans lendemain.\n"
"\n"
"Qui est prêt pour toi ce soir ? Découvrons-le ! 🔥\n"

#: app/text.py:144
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something deeper? You're now browsing guys seeking meaningful"
" connections and romance.\n"
"\n"
"Your match might be one swipe away! 💕\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating activé !</b>\n"
"\n"
"Envie de sentiments sincères ? Tu découvres maintenant des mecs à la "
"recherche d'amour et de romance.\n"
"\n"
"Ton âme sœur n'est peut-être qu'à un swipe ! 💕\n"

#: app/text.py:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe! You're now browsing guys looking for genuine "
"friendships and community.\n"
"\n"
"Let's expand your chosen family! 🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends activé !</b>\n"
"\n"
"Construis ta tribu ! Tu découvres maintenant des mecs à la recherche "
"d'amitiés sincères et d'entraide.\n"
"\n"
"Agrandissons ta famille de cœur ! 🌈\n"

#: app/text.py:164
